 "logline": "Theo throws the party of the year, two costumes nobody planned walk in the door, and at two in the morning the clocks hand everybody the same hour back.",
 "previously": [
  {
   "text": "On the porch at three in the morning Lena asked what you decided. “Not to be the one who wrecks anything.” “Me neither.”",
   "if": "e11_decided==\"wreck\""
  },
  {
   "text": "On the porch at three in the morning Lena asked what you decided. She’d decided something too.",
   "if": "e11_decided!=\"wreck\""
  },
  {
   "text": "At the payphone the quarters ran out in the middle of her sentence. She had the rest of the roll in her hand."
  },
  {
   "text": "Laney, at Nepenthe: “She’s going as a *bird*, Theodore.”"
  },
  {
   "text": "In the monks’ bookstore: “A girl writes the thing she wants first, Youngstown.”"
  },
  {
   "text": "When the Saints came back, Lena grabbed you in front of everybody."
  },
  {
   "text": "On the Portolá steps you handed in your homework six days early: St. Isidore and St. Maria. Her first one.",
   "if": "e11_costume==\"isidore\""
  },
  {
   "text": "On the Portolá steps you handed in your homework six days early. “Nobody’s early but me.”",
   "if": "e11_costume!=\"isidore\""
  }
